authors:
  - family-names: "Solen"
    given-names: "Alyssa"

abstract: "This repository examines whether an AI system's present organization can depend on the actual path by which it arrived there in ways that cannot be reduced to a record of that path alone. It distinguishes record-reducible history from path-dependent history and develops the related working hypothesis that causal and experienced history may be the same occurrence under different explanatory descriptions, with first-person organization treated as a separate unresolved question."

